WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:08.780
My first introduction to Hillsdale College
was my high school literature teacher brought

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.650
us to a play here on campus.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:16.290
My step-grandmother, who attended Hillsdale
College many, many years ago, encouraged me

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:19.360
to apply for a job here at Hillsdale.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:26.800
So I did, and I started on September 3rd,
1968, and I started in the admissions department.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.810
I worked for Hillsdale College almost 46 years.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.000
I have worked for five athletic directors.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.949
Each one of them have impacted my life.

00:00:36.949 --> 00:00:43.429
To work for these great men has just been
wonderful, and the student athletes ... It's

00:00:43.429 --> 00:00:50.989
been so rewarding to watch them grow in their
skill of sport as well as mature into fine

00:00:50.989 --> 00:00:52.449
men and women.

00:00:52.449 --> 00:00:53.449
It's so much fun.

00:00:53.449 --> 00:01:00.109
I've kept contact with many coaches and student
athletes, and it's just really been wonderful.

00:01:00.109 --> 00:01:03.539
I don't think I should say a favorite sport.

00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:09.630
I suppose basketball is my favorite, but that
might have to do with the weather a bit as

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.729
well.

00:01:10.729 --> 00:01:18.359
The whole athletic department is like a family,
and I have to say the entire college is, too.

00:01:18.359 --> 00:01:22.549
When there was a need, everyone would pitch
in and work together.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.270
Everyone cares about each other.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:33.060
The three most important things in my life:
Faith, my family, and my Charger Family.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:37.330
To be inducted into the Hall of Fame, I still
can't quite believe it's happening.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.820
I received the letter in the mail.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:41.369
It said, "Congratulations.

00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:47.620
You are being inducted," and of course, I
had mailed out that letter for many years

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:48.620
to people.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:57.810
I looked at it and I put it down, and I looked
at it again, and I thought, "I just can't

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:58.869
believe this."

00:01:58.869 --> 00:02:02.070
I'm honored, I'm humbled, I'm astounded.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.249
It's just wonderful.

00:02:04.249 --> 00:02:06.660
It's just wonderful.

